.* CFGCMN: the task menu for communications configuration.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CFGCMN'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CFGCMN HELP=HLPCFGCMN KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Configure Communications and Remote Hardware
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKLIND'.Work with lines
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCTLD'.Work with communications controllers
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCTLD'.Work with work station controllers
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*CMN)'.Work with communications devices
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*PRT)'.Work with printers
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DSP)'.Work with display stations
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='CMD ?WRKMODD'.Work with modes
:MENUI OPTION=8 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCOSD'.Work with classes-of-service
:MENUI OPTION=9 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCFGL'.Work with configuration lists
:MENUI OPTION=10 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNWID'.Work with network interfaces
:MENUI OPTION=11 ACTION='CMD ?WRKCNNL'.Work with connection lists
:MENUI OPTION=12 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNWSD'.Work with network servers
:MENUI OPTION=13 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNTBD'.Work with NetBIOS descriptions
:MENUI OPTION=20 ACTION='CMD CFGTCP'.Configure TCP/IP
:MENUI OPTION=30 ACTION='MENU CFGPCS'.Configure personal computer connections
:MENUI OPTION=40 ACTION='CMD ?WRKNWSCFG'.Configure network server
:MENUI OPTION=41 ACTION='MENU NWSADM'.Network server administration
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPCFGCMN.Configure Communications and Remote Hardware - Help
:P.The lines, controllers and devices that connect this system to others,
and TCP/IP. Options for functions this release does not have say so.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
